<p>Use this dialog box to edit and create Overlay Setting. Use an ".rpo" 
 Overlay Data file. </p>
<p class="Note">Note:</p>
<ul>
<li><p>To print the same Overlay Data using different 
 setting configurations, provide each of the available data combinations 
 with its own overlay data name and register those names in advance.</p></li>
</ul>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="overlay" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Overlay Data:</span></p>
<p>Select an Overlay Setting that you want to edit or delete from the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="delete" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Delete</span></p>
<p>Deletes the current Overlay Setting.</p>
<p aria-level="2" class="T1" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Edit</span></p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="name" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Name:</span></p>
<p>Enter a name for the Overlay Setting.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="path" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Path/File Name:</span></p>
<p>Enter the path and file name for the Overlay Data file.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="browse" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Browse...</span></p>
<p>Browse for the file you want to use as Overlay Data.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="add" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Add</span></p>
<p>Adds an edited Overlay Setting as a new Overlay Setting to the list.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="update" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Update</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes after editing an Overlay Setting.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="front" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Bring to Front</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to move the Overlay Data to the front.<br/>
The text under the Overlay Data will not be visible.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="firstpage" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">First Page Only</span></p>
<p>Select the check box to superimpose the Overlay Data on only the first 
 page of a document.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
